- Initial package of crunch 3.6: upstream does not git-tag releases, so the
  _service pins the master commit that declares VERSION 3.6 in the Makefile
  and carries the version literally; built with the distro gcc and the
  Makefile's -g -o0 OPTFLAGS overridden by the RPM flags.
